  "creatures.skycraft.guard.says": "%s: \"%s\"",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.0": "I walked the old roads once, same as you. Then a draugr's axe found my shoulder, and here I stand.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.1": "Lost something, traveller? Check the tavern before you check with me.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.2": "Watch the skies, traveler.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.3": "Keep moving. Loitering's for beggars and spies.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.4": "Citizen.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.5": "Disrespect the law, and you disrespect me.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.6": "Gotta keep my eyes open. Damn dragons could swoop down at any time.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.7": "I'd be a lot warmer and a lot happier with a bellyful of mead...",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.8": "What is it? Dragons?",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.9": "Everything's in order.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.10": "Trouble?",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.11": "I mostly deal with petty thievery and drunken brawls. Been too long since we've had a good bandit raid.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.12": "My cousin's out fighting dragons, and what do I get? Guard duty.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.13": "Wait... I know you.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.14": "Keep your nose clean, and you won't have any trouble with me.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.15": "Fear not. Come dragon or giant, we'll be ready.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.16": "Only burglars and grave robbers wear masks.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.17": "Hands to yourself, sneak thief.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.18": "Stay out of trouble, and we'll get along fine.",
  "creatures.skycraft.guard.line.19": "Don't suppose you'd fetch me a hot mead from the inn? Didn't think so.",
  "creatures.skycraft.giant.warning": "The giant stomps the ground in warning. Back away!",
  "creatures.skycraft.shout.fus_ro": "FUS... RO...",
  "creatures.skycraft.shout.dah": "DAH!",
  "creatures.skycraft.shout.fo_krah_diin": "FO KRAH DIIN!",
